eers, declining at 21%/yr \u2014 weakening productivity. Stock-based compensation of $302K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 2\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Core Scientific, Inc. is a mid-cap technology business with a $3.8B market cap on $319M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -21% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Gross margins of 18% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The company is burning through $451M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at -24.1% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, thin -16.2\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 31% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-1.9) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (27.0% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Revenue growth in the bottom decile of Technology peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"red","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins 84% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 804% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":8.04324692599682},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (93% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.071},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Technology peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Core Scientific Inc (CORZ) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Colocation Revenue Surges 60% as ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/core-scientific-inc-corz-q3-210904821.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793999344.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Core Scientific Sees Unusually Large Options Volume (NASDAQ:CORZ)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/core-scientific-sees-unusually-large-options-volume-nasdaqcorz.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793995266.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.681,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Core Scientific (NASDAQ:CORZ) Stock Gets Price Target Reduction from Needham & Company LLC","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/core-scientific-nasdaqcorz-stock-gets-price-target-reduction-from-needham-company-llc.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793